    books,ahead,house,salary,three,covered,curvature,named,folded,
    on_course R hG (roots hG R.metals.p R.metals.K) (rollTab hG R.metals R.rolls)
      C books ahead house salary.1 salary.2 protect charged,charged,protect⟩

